    "A hundred AI scholars stand by, awaiting your command. As the keeper of the imperial seal in the era of intelligence, you will witness the grand strategies presented by the Cabinet of Thought amidst the most surging tide of computational power in the 21st century. And you, the most eagerly anticipated pioneer of this century’s technological revolution, are cordially invited by the AI Academy to review the wisdom of a hundred models. In this unprecedented cognitive feast, let us compose a new chapter that belongs to you in the digital age!" : {
