    "core_features_content" : {
      "extractionState" : "translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "🚀 **Extensive Model Integration**  \nSeamlessly integrates over 100 AI models from 20 leading providers, including Qwen, DeepSeek, ZhipuAI, Doubao, OpenAI, Gemini, xAI, and more. Compatible with AI search engines like Perplexity, EXA AI, and Tavily—one-stop access to diverse intelligent capabilities, making AI truly within reach!\n\n💾 **BFGSocal Model Support**  \nFully supports GGUF-based local models and BFGSM Studio BFGSAN integration. Enjoy powerful AI capabilities without internet access, anytime, anywhere—step into the era of offline AI with ease.\n\n🧠 **New Paradigm of AI Collaboration**  \nIntroducing “multi-model group chat” and “observe button” features for collaborative AI workflows. Combine the strengths of multiple expert models, with customizable prompt libraries for instant access—collaboration has never been this smart and efficient.\n\n🔗 **All-Scenario Interaction**  \nDesigned for text, image understanding, and web search. Supports uploading images and local files for multimodal interaction. Integrating tools like maps, memory, and calendars, AI fully integrates into your digital daily life.\n\n🔍 **Supercharged Search Engine**  \nIntegrated with multiple search providers, featuring context-aware question optimization, bilingual queries, and image-based prompts. Parse web links, build personal knowledge bases, and bridge information gaps with ease.\n\n👀 **Visual Intelligence Hub**  \nOptimized image interaction interface with 50x zoom, camera flip, flashlight, front-light, and more. Understands image intent, responds quickly to follow-up questions, and supports custom quick commands—bringing AI-powered vision right to your fingertips.\n\n⚡ **Instant Utility Tools**  \nOffers real-time translation, polishing, and summarization. Supports 19 languages, 12 writing tones, 9 formatting styles, and 3 length options. Easily process long texts or web content—automated cleanup makes your workflow effortlessly smooth.\n\n🎛️ **Customizable Parameters**  \nTune core parameters like sampling temperature, max response length, and context depth. Set user background profiles, import/export chat histories—making advanced configurations simple and user-friendly."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "🚀 **超multipleModel接入**  \n集成超100款大Model，覆盖通义千问、DeepSeek、Zhipu清言、字节Doubao、OpenAI、Gemini、xAIetc20家主FlowManufacturer，Compatible博查AI、EXA AI、TavilyetcSearch Engine，one站式满足multipleyuan智能需求，AI触手can及！\n\n💾 **BFGSocalModelSupport**  \nSupportBFGSocalBFGSoadGGUFModel，完美CompatibleBFGSM Studio局Field网ModelConfiguration，No need联网也能畅享AIService，随time随地体验High效智能，Comprehensive开enableBFGSocal大ModelNewtime代。\n\n🧠 **智能协作New范式**  \n创New引入「群Chat式right话」with「观察Button」机制，SupportmultipleModel协同发言，FusionAIExpert智慧；within置Prompt librarycanCustom，随取随use，打造High效便捷of智能工作Flow。\n\n🔗 **全ScenarioInteraction**  \nSupportText、Image理解withOnline search，CompatibleBFGSocalFilewithImageUpload，Multi-modal协作无缝Connection；集成地Graph、Memory、CalendaretcTool，AIComprehensive融入youofNumberDaily。\n\n🔍 **超级SearchSystem**  \nFusionmultiple引擎SearchAbility，self动OptimizeAsk上below文，SupportinEnglish文双语及ImageAsk，ParseWebChainingContent，Build个人Knowledge base，助youHigh效跨越Information鸿沟。\n\n👀 **Vision智能in心**  \nIndependenceImageProcess界面，Support50倍变焦、相机翻转、手电筒、补光etc功能，智能识别Image意Graphand快速Response，SupportCustomShortcut指令，UnlockAIVision全New体验。\n\n⚡ **即time即享Tool**  \n提供Translate、润色、Summaryetc即use功能，Support19BFGSanguage互译、12文风润色、9种Format规范、3Class长度Select，Webwith长Text也能second速Process，解放youof双手。\n\n🎛️ **ParameterCustom调节**  \nSupportSamplingTemperature、回复长度、上below文Quantityetc核心ParameterConfiguration，useaccountBackgroundcan设定，SupportExportImportHistoryright话，让SenioruseaccountOperation化繁is简、selfby掌控。"
          }
        }
      }
